cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Atlas in research, cite this release. Apache-2.0 licenses Atlas-authored software; it does not license third-party data or dependencies."
title: "Atlas: The Evidence-First Financial Research Operating System"
version: "0.2.0-beta.1"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/Satwik-P28/Atlas"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Satwik-P28/Atlas"
abstract: >-
  Atlas connects financial questions to exact SEC source evidence, typed computations and independent
  verification, and refuses ambiguous or unsupported questions with structured reasons. It provides a
  point-in-time evidence kernel, a financial-economic compiler, geometry-aware answer resolution,
  declarative research application packages and a local research terminal.
keywords:
  - financial research
  - SEC EDGAR
  - evidence grounding
  - point-in-time data
  - reproducibility
  - abstention
  - financial statement analysis
authors:
